COMBAT MISSION: Engage an iron golem with two soldiers.

Location: Near the target area
Role: Soldier1
Combat Role: TANK

OBJECTIVE: Engage iron golem first.

TARGET: iron_golem

EQUIPMENT: Weapon: best available melee, Armor: whatever equipped

TACTICS:
1. Use the provided attack code template exactly as written
2. Search for "iron_golem" target within 30 blocks
3. Equip best available melee weapon from inventory
4. Scan for all entities/players around you
5. Start attack loop with timeout protection
6. Log all combat events to console
7. Retreat if health drops below 12 (6 hearts)

RETREAT CONDITION: bot.health < 12

CONSTRAINTS:
- Do NOT use bot.pathfinder.
- Stay within 30 blocks of rallyPoint.
- Maintain ~3+ blocks spacing from Soldier2.

TARGET INFORMATION:
- Target Name: iron_golem
- Target Type: mob
- Search Range: 30 blocks
- Melee Range: 3.5 blocks

REQUIRED CODE PATTERNS (MUST USE ALL):
- const MELEE_RANGE = 3.5
- const maxCombatTime = 60000
- const startTime = Date.now()
- while (target && target.isValid && (Date.now() - startTime) < maxCombatTime)
- if (distance <= MELEE_RANGE)
- await bot.attack(target)
- await skills.wait(bot, 300)
- console.log('[Soldier1]')
- bot.setControlState('forward', true)

BANNED CODE (DO NOT USE - WILL BREAK):
- bot.pathfinder
- GoalNear, GoalBlock, GoalFollow, GoalXZ
- bot.navigate
- skills.stay(bot, -1)
- while (true)

ATTACK CODE TEMPLATE:
const MELEE_RANGE = 3.5;
const maxCombatTime = 60000;
const startTime = Date.now();

console.log('[Soldier1] === COMBAT START ===');
console.log('[Soldier1] Position:', bot.entity.position);

const weapon = bot.inventory.items().find(i => i.name.includes('sword')) || bot.inventory.items().find(i => i.name.includes('axe')) || null;
console.log('[Soldier1] Weapon:', weapon ? weapon.name : 'NONE (fists)');
if (weapon) await bot.equip(weapon, 'hand');

const allEntities = Object.values(bot.entities).filter(e => e.name);
console.log('[Soldier1] All entities:', allEntities.slice(0, 10).map(e => e.name + ' (' + Math.floor(e.position.distanceTo(bot.entity.position)) + 'm)').join(', '));

// Search for target: iron_golem
let target = Object.values(bot.entities).find(e => 
  e.name && 
  e.name.toLowerCase().includes('iron') && e.name.toLowerCase().includes('golem') &&
  e.position.distanceTo(bot.entity.position) < 30
);

console.log('[Soldier1] Target iron_golem:', target ? 'FOUND at ' + Math.floor(target.position.distanceTo(bot.entity.position)) + 'm' : 'NOT FOUND');

if (target) {
  console.log('[Soldier1] Starting attack');
  let hits = 0;

  while (target && target.isValid && (Date.now() - startTime) < maxCombatTime) {
    if (bot.health < 12) {
      console.log('[Soldier1] Low health (' + bot.health + '/20), retreating');
      await skills.moveAway(bot, 10);
      break;
    }

    const distance = target.position.distanceTo(bot.entity.position);

    if (distance <= MELEE_RANGE) {
      await bot.lookAt(target.position);
      await bot.attack(target);
      hits++;
      if (hits % 3 === 0) console.log('[Soldier1] Hits: ' + hits + ', Health: ' + bot.health);
    } else {
      // Move closer to target
      await bot.lookAt(target.position);
      bot.setControlState('forward', true);
    }

    await skills.wait(bot, 300);
    target = target && target.isValid ? target : null;
  }

  console.log('[Soldier1] Combat done - Total hits: ' + hits + ', Final health: ' + bot.health);
  if ((Date.now() - startTime) >= maxCombatTime) {
    console.log('[Soldier1] Combat timeout (60 seconds) reached');
  }
} else {
  console.log('[Soldier1] ERROR: No iron_golem found within 30 blocks!');
}

console.log('[Soldier1] Holding position');
bot.setControlState('forward', false);


